Z||000011||Flamberge||10-08-2001||04:36 AM||||Maybe this has been brought up before, but what is the "fastest" car you all have ever beaten in a legitamate street light race (i.e. you both knew about it, etc)<P>For me, I beat an Audi TT roadster (the upside-down bathtub one) after second gear. He stayed with me in first, but my second was taller and then he became a rear-view mirror memory. The sad thing is, I was in my beat up 85 SE, though it did have a manual so I could rev it and drop the clutch; and he was in a 40 grand garage queen.<P>I should add I never race with my 88 GT, since I want to keep it very nice.<P>Anyone else? (And while I am on the subject, one of the nicest cars I ever lost to was some large Acura Coupe, not the integra... I stayed with the guy through third must missed forth gear and he beat me.<P>- Flamberge||||reg||5
